    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2015" root="بدن" body-key="b">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بدّن</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبْدِينٌ</span>, <i>He</i> (a man, T, S, M)
<i>was,</i> or <i>became, aged,</i> (T, S, M, Mgh, Msb, K,)
<i>and weak:</i> (M, K:) or <i>he was, or became, heavy
by reason of age;</i> as also ↓<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَنَ</span>. (Ham p. 158.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>He clad</i> a man <i>with a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَن</span>, i. e. a <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِرْع</span> [or
<i>coat of mail</i>]. (K,* TA.)

